        "tags": [
          "calling",
          "stalwart",
          "tier-1"
        ],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Stalwart \u2014 Apprentice</strong> (Tier I).</p><p><strong>Trade \u2014 Haul and raise:</strong> A day's heavy labor \u2014 cargo moved, wall raised, field cleared. <span style=\"opacity:0.7\">Standard fee 10 marks (Economy).</span></p><p><strong>Trick \u2014 Put Your Back Into It</strong> <em>(1/scene)</em>: Auto-succeed one feat of raw strength or endurance of tier-appropriate difficulty.</p>",
